## Lab-Grown: Round Brilliant vs Radiant Cut

Lab-grown diamonds are identical in chemistry and appearance to natural diamonds. In the lab-grown market, the savings vs natural are dramatic at all sizes — and the round vs radiant comparison plays out differently when both shapes are available at lab prices.

Ring totals use the [Knife Edge Solitaire at $925](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/knife-edge-solitaire-by-james-allen-item-316048?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

